# Traced diagram references (KAJI_DECISIONS §3.5). These are derived from the
# publisher's artwork — tracing changes the file format, not who owns the
# drawing. Fine locally as a layout brief for an illustrator; committing them to
# a PUBLIC repo would redistribute the illustration. scripts/check-diagrams.mjs
# fails the build if one is ever tracked or lands in a shipping path.
